ÁGUIA DE OURO, LDA

25
00:17:41,375 --> 00:17:45,625
<i>Negros teus cabelos</i>
<i>Cobriam o teu corpo</i>

26
00:17:46,333 --> 00:17:48,958
<i>Tão cheia de amor</i>

27
00:17:49,375 --> 00:17:51,833
<i>Te vi dançando</i>

28
00:17:51,916 --> 00:17:54,083
<i>Outro te abraçava</i>

29
00:17:54,166 --> 00:17:56,333
<i>Outro te beijava</i>

30
00:17:56,833 --> 00:17:59,000
<i>Mas era para mim</i>

31
00:17:59,833 --> 00:18:02,000
<i>Para quem olhavas</i>

32
00:18:02,083 --> 00:18:04,458
<i>Rosto de cigana</i>

33
00:18:04,541 --> 00:18:06,958
<i>Doce apaixonada</i>

34
00:18:07,041 --> 00:18:09,250
<i>Que me deste amor</i>

35
00:18:09,875 --> 00:18:12,000
<i>Como uma espada</i>

36
00:18:12,083 --> 00:18:14,458
<i>Vou pelos caminhos</i>

37
00:18:14,541 --> 00:18:17,000
<i>Pagas teu destino</i>

38
00:18:17,083 --> 00:18:19,750
<i>Vives o amor</i>

39
00:18:19,833 --> 00:18:22,125
<i>Roubas carinho</i>

40
00:18:22,625 --> 00:18:26,333
<i>Onde estão os teus olhos</i>
<i>Tão profundos</i>

41
00:18:26,750 --> 00:18:30,916
<i>E o fogo dos teus lábios</i>
<i>Que eram meus</i>

42
00:18:31,708 --> 00:18:35,625
<i>O vinho que bebo</i>
<i>Abre-me as feridas</i>

43
00:18:36,333 --> 00:18:40,916
<i>Me embebeda</i>
<i>E mais te quero toda a vida</i>

